{"id": 1326, "name": "France Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.in.gov/counties/cass/france-park/", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://www.in.gov/counties/cass/france-park/rates-and-reservations/", "lines": [" in Primitive Sites | Sites cannot be reserved by a customer, for another customer, unless the transaction is paid in full at the time of reservation. | For private group rentals (Recreation Building, and Flory Shelter) $150 damage deposit must be paid to confirm the reservation; upon arrival, $150 must be paid along with the $5 gate fee for each attendee, unless other arrangements are made. If the area is found to b", "be paid to confirm the reservation; upon arrival, $150 must be paid along with the $5 gate fee for each attendee, unless other arrangements are made. If the area is found to be clean upon inspection after the event, the $150 damage deposit will be refunded to the customer. | The waterfall area is non-reservable. | If a customer does not show up by check-in on the second day of the reservation, it becomes forfeit, unl", "you will need to have their complete information. | Cancellations | Only the reservation holder can cancel or make changes to an existing reservation. | If a reservation is canceled 8 or more days before arrival, a flat $10 cancellation fee will be charged (per site that is canceled.) | If a reservation is canceled between 1 and 7 days before arrival, the first night's rental fee will be charged as a cancellation fee", "ental fee. | Reservation dates may be switched upon request; however, it is not guaranteed you will get the same site. (Does not apply on holiday weekends.) | No refunds will be given due to inclement weather | Note the $5 reservation fee is a separate fee and will not be included with your cancellation as it is a processing fee. | France Park Golf Cart Rules 2026 | * Campers must register their golf carts at the cam", "on passes are from Jan.1 - Dec.31 | Golf Cart Pass must be purchased, and proof of insurance is required. The pass and insurance are required for all golf carts. Proof of insurance can be mailed to the park. The cost is $25.00 and will be good for the calendar year and purchased annually. | France Park | Contact Us | 4505 W US 24 | Logansport, IN 46947 | Phone : (574) 753-2928 | Email : fpark@francepark.com | Contact"], "via": "Rates & Reservations"}, {"url": "https://www.in.gov/core/sitesurvey.html", "lines": [], "via": "IN.gov User Survey"}, {"url": "https://www.in.gov/core/accessibility-feedback.html", "lines": [], "via": "Report Accessibility Issues"}, {"url": "https://app.fireflyreservations.com/reserve/property/FrancePark", "lines": ["picnic table playgrounds pull through restrooms secluded shade sunshine water yard space Class | All Classes 30 amp RV Site 50/30 amp RV Site Primitive Camping Seasonal Site Apply Powered by Firefly Reservations 0 Units $0.00 View Hide Continue"]}]}
